# Screen chrome spacing

Three families — do not merge their geometry:

| Family | Shell | Mid-list errors | Cold empty |
|---|---|---|---|
| Glass lists | `OsAppScreen` + compact/glass | `OsChromeListAlert` | `ListLoadError` |
| Immersive | Guild / hero (`immersiveHeader`) | Rail-aware overlay | In-flow state card |
| Sheets / forms | Gesture / glass sheets | Whisper only if shoving painted rows | In-flow hint |

## Shared

- Measure permanent chrome (`--os-screen-chrome-height`); tuck is visual-only (freeze inset).
- Under-chrome overlays: `.os-chrome-whisper-anchor` — never reserve flow when hidden.
- Messages sealed-thread hint: `OsChromeWhisper` (do not in-flow shove bubbles). Passkey hint stays overlay and hides on the thread pane.
- Body inset: `OsAppChromePage` / `--os-screen-body-inset` — no feature-level padding inventing numbers.
- Dock: `--portfolio-dock-clearance`.

## Live vs cold

- Painted rows → overlay (`OsChromeListAlert`).
- Empty / first paint → in-flow (`ListLoadError`).
- Soft revalidate that keeps a cache must keep painting the cache and whisper the failure — never blank to `ListLoadError`.
